      </div>

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6">Sources</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base">
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/about-the-bc-provincial-nominee-program/news" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">WelcomeBC: BC PNP news (April 23 and August 18, 2026)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/bc-pnp-archived-news-2025-pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">WelcomeBC: BC PNP archived news 2025 (allocation history, PDF)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/invitations-to-apply" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">WelcomeBC: Invitations to apply and registration pool</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/about-the-bc-provincial-nominee-program/about-the-bc-provincial-nominee-program" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">WelcomeBC: Program objectives and selection of workers</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/bc-pnp-si-program-guide-pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">BC PNP Skills Immigration Program Guide (PDF)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/skills-immigration" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">WelcomeBC: Skills Immigration (fees and processing times)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/corporate/mandate/corporate-initiatives/levels/supplementary-immigration-levels-2026-2028.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">IRCC: Supplementary Information for the 2026–2028 Immigration Levels Plan</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/corporate/transparency/consultations/2026-consultations-express-entry-selection.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">IRCC: 2026 consultations on Express Entry category-based selection</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/i-2.5/page-13.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Justice Laws: Immigration and Refugee Protection Act, section 94</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-4">Information current as of October 14, 2026. Program rules change often; confirm on WelcomeBC or IRCC before applying.</p>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Related Articles</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/articles/bc-pnp-2026-draws-recap-2027-forecast" class="block bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 rounded-2xl hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
